## 2. End-to-End User Flow

### 2.1 Happy Path — Decision Approved

An agent makes a compliant decision. NullifyAI evaluates it, finds no violations, returns `APPROVED`, and the agent proceeds normally.

```
Agent Code                SDK                  Enforcement API              Downstream System
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
agent.action(payload)
    │
    ▼
nullify.wrap(agent)
    │
    │  [+1ms] Intercept Layer
    │  Serialize payload + agent metadata
    │  POST /v1/evaluate ──────────────────▶
    │                                        [+4ms] Policy Engine
    │                                        Evaluate 50+ rules in parallel
    │                                        All rules PASS
    │                                        │
    │                                        [+3ms] Drift Detector
    │                                        Score current decision vs 7-day baseline
    │                                        Drift score: 18  (Healthy, 0–30)
    │                                        │
    │                                        [+2ms] Verdict Engine
    │                                        Compose verdict: APPROVED
    │                                        Sign record: HMAC-SHA256
    │                                        │
    │◀───────────────────────────────────── 200 OK { verdict: "APPROVED", latency: 9ms }
    │                                        │
    │                                        [async] Audit Logger
    │                                        Write signed record → S3 + DynamoDB
    │
    ▼
agent proceeds → calls downstream system ──────────────────────────────────▶ EHR / LOS / DB
```

**Total added latency:** ~9ms (P95 ≤10ms)
**Agent behavior:** unchanged — proceeds exactly as if NullifyAI were not present.

