### 2.4 Drift Detection Flow

Drift detection runs **in parallel** with policy evaluation on every decision. It compares the current decision's behavioral signature against the agent's 7-day rolling baseline.

```
Every Decision (continuous)
───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
incoming decision payload
    │
    ▼
Baseline ML Scorer                             CUSUM Engine
┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                                                              │
│  Extract features:                                           │
│    - decision_type distribution                              │
│    - confidence scores (mean, std)                           │
│    - violation rate (rolling 1h)                             │
│    - block rate (rolling 1h)                                 │
│    - output token length (for LLM agents)                    │
│                                                              │
│  Compare to 7-day baseline (EWMA-smoothed per agent)         │
│                                                              │
│  Drift Score =                                               │
│    distribution_shift  × 0.40                                │
│    + violation_rate_Δ  × 0.35                                │
│    + block_rate_delta  × 0.25                                │
│                                                              │
│  Score: 0–100                                                │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
    │
    ▼
Score Threshold Router
┌─────────────┬──────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ 0–30        │ Healthy — no action                          │
│ 31–60       │ Warning — Slack alert → #compliance-alerts   │
│ 61–80       │ Critical — PagerDuty L2 incident fired       │
│ 81–100      │ Severe — agent BLOCKED; L2 incident + Slack  │
└─────────────┴──────────────────────────────────────────────┘
    │
    ▼
Audit record updated with drift_score field
Dashboard agent card updates color in real-time (WebSocket push)
```

