### 2.6 Compliance Audit Export Flow

Used when an operator needs to produce a tamper-proof audit report for a regulator (e.g., EU AI Act Article 13 audit).

```
Operator / Auditor                 NullifyAI Portal           Storage Layer
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
1. Navigate to Audit Export tab
   Select: agent(s), date range, verdict filter
   │
   ▼
2. POST /v1/audit/export
   { agent_id, from, to, format: "pdf" | "csv" }
   │
   └──▶ Audit Service queries DynamoDB (index: agent_id + timestamp)
        Fetches all matching records from S3 (append-only Object Lock)
        Re-validates HMAC-SHA256 signature on each record
        If any signature fails → record flagged as TAMPERED in report
        │
        ▼
3. Generate report artifact
   Includes: decision_id, agent_id, timestamp, payload hash,
             verdict, rule_id, drift_score, HMAC signature
   Signed PDF / CSV produced
   │
   ▼
4. Operator downloads → provides to auditor
   Auditor can independently verify signatures using public key
   Retention: 7 years (S3 Object Lock — cannot be deleted)
```

