| `/v1/agents/{id}/rules` | GET / PUT | Get or update active policy for an agent | JWT | <100ms |
| `/v1/agents/{id}/baseline` | GET | Retrieve current 7-day baseline stats | JWT | <200ms |
| `/v1/audit` | GET | Query audit log (paginated, filterable) | JWT | <500ms |
| `/v1/audit/export` | POST | Generate CSV or PDF audit export | JWT | <30s |
| `/v1/escalations` | GET / POST | List open escalations or submit an outcome | JWT | <200ms |
| `/v1/rules` | GET / POST | Browse rule library or create custom rule | JWT | <200ms |
| `/v1/rules/{id}/deploy` | POST | Activate a rule into a live policy set | JWT | <5s |
