## 5. Security & Compliance Boundaries

```
┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  Trust Boundary 1 — Customer ↔ NullifyAI Cloud                                 │
│                                                                                  │
│  All traffic over TLS 1.3                                                       │
│  API key authentication on /v1/evaluate (scoped per agent)                     │
│  JWT (RS256) for all management plane endpoints                                  │
│  Rate limiting: 10,000 req/s per tenant (sliding window, Redis-backed)          │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  Trust Boundary 2 — NullifyAI Services (internal)                              │
│                                                                                  │
│  ECS tasks run with least-privilege IAM roles (no wildcard S3/DDB permissions) │
│  Secrets Manager for all credentials (no env var injection)                     │
│  VPC with private subnets; no public IPs on ECS tasks                          │
│  NLB terminates TLS; ECS tasks communicate over private VPC only               │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  Data Isolation                                                                 │
│                                                                                  │
│  Tenant data is logically isolated (tenant_id partition key on all tables)      │
│  S3 Object Lock prevents audit record mutation or deletion for 7 years          │
│  KMS key rotation: annual (per-tenant keys)                                     │
│  HMAC signing key rotation: quarterly (key_id tracked per audit record)        │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  Regulatory Coverage                                                            │
│                                                                                  │
│  EU AI Act (Aug 2026)  — Article 13 audit trail; eu-west-1 data residency      │
│  HIPAA                 — BAA available; PHI never stored in payload             │
│  SOC 2 Type I          — Audit in progress; Type II planned Year 1             │
│  GDPR                  — eu-west-1 residency; right-to-erasure process TBD     │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

